WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.300
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and and here’s
my Game of Thrones Season 4 Preview for Tywin

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.300
Lannister.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.710
The true king of Westeros and the greatest
joy vampire you’ve ever met.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.900
Just try to be happy around him.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.200
I dare you.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:32.050
So first I’ll talk about how tywin’s character
develops in season 4 and then I’ll list

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.390
my all time top 5 Worst Twyin Lannister Moments.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:38.640
If you’ve never seen any of my season 4
previews or your finding me for the first

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.640
time.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.930
Spoilers for everything in books 1 through
3 and partial spoilers for book 4 and dance

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:44.930
with dragons.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:51.380
Tywin Lannister really only cares about House
Lannister and as a family man he really only

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.730
cares about how the rest of the Lannisters
reflect of him.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.610
That’s why you always see him making Tyrion,
Jaime and Cersei do strange things.

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.440
It’s hard to say whether he believes that
Joffrey is really Jaime’s son, but during

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.430
season 3 he orders Cersei to marry Loras just
so that the rumors will stop.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:03.430
He never acknowledges that they’re true.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.710
He also never acknowledges that Loras is really
gay.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.590
So he doesn’t really care about his children.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.939
He just cares about what they can do to help
or hurt the Lannister name.

00:01:09.939 --> 00:01:13.010
That’s why no matter how smart Tyrion is,
he’ll always hate him, because the rest

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.470
of westeros just thinks of him as the imp.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:15.470
But he’s a lannister imp goddamit.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:20.750
So really all Tywin is waiting for is an excuse
to kill Tyrion that won’t reflect badly

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:21.750
on House Lannister.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.180
And Season 4 gives him that chance.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.930
Tyrion get’s blamed for the *super spoilery*
event in King’s Landing and while we don’t

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:31.450
have any Tywin POV chapters, it’s implied
that Tywin acts like Tyrion is guilty.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.270
Tyrion is put on trial and since it’s a
solution to Tywin’s “Tyrion” problem

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.690
I think he doesn’t care whether Tyrion is
actually guilty.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:41.340
If you saw the scene with Tyrion and Tywin
at the end of season 3.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.250
That wasn’t in the books, the actors improvised
it just because Peter Dinklage and Charles

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.250
Dance are so awesome.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.570
It let’s you know that Tyrion is hanging
by a thread.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.790
Tywin is just looking for the right excuse
to get rid of him.

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.890
And Season 4 is where he gets that chance.

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:59.660
But if you thought that bad guys always win
in Game of Thrones, you are wrong.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.860
Bullies never win in the end.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:06.540
We can’t predict what specifically they’ll
change from the books to the show, but I expect

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.789
the untimely demise of westeros’ greatest
bully to go down just the way it does in the

00:02:09.789 --> 00:02:10.789
books.

00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:17.510
With some improvised dialogue from Peter Dinklage
and Charles Dance of course.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:22.650
But here’s my list of Top 5 Worst Tywin
Lannister Moments So Far:

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:26.419
Number 5 - Killing the Last of The Targaryen’s
or so he thought.

00:02:26.419 --> 00:02:32.910
Tywin ordered the murder of prince rhaeger
and elia of dorne and their children.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:33.910
I don’t know if the success or failure of
this will make it to the show.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:34.910
So I won’t include any spoilers for the
mummer’s dragon.

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:39.989
But the red viper is Elia’s sister and he’ll
be trying to find out who killed Elia during

00:02:39.989 --> 00:02:40.989
season 4.

00:02:40.989 --> 00:02:44.129
Number 4 - Hiring the Bloody Mummers to Burn
the Riverlands during the war of the five

00:02:44.129 --> 00:02:49.209
kings.

00:02:49.209 --> 00:02:53.849
On the show these characters are replaced
by Locke and his group of men.

00:02:53.849 --> 00:02:58.029
He was the one that cut Jaime’s hand off.

00:02:58.029 --> 00:03:01.139
So you can think of that as a small form of
Karmic retribution for tywin.

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:02.700
Number 3 - The Rains of Castamere.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.019
So this refers to an event and a song based
on the event.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.120
The song was turned into the Lannister theme
on the show.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.120
So anytime there’s a lannister scene, the
tune plays softly in the background.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.260
The event it refers to is when House Reyne
and House Tarbeck rebelled against their liege

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:12.040
lord Tywin’s father.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:17.069
In response Tywin killed every member of their
families and burned their castles.

00:03:17.069 --> 00:03:23.989
It was so terrible that the people of westeros
turned it into a song, that now plays every

00:03:23.989 --> 00:03:25.589
time a lannister appears on screen in the
show.

00:03:25.589 --> 00:03:29.540
Number 2 - The untimely demise of Tyrion’s
first wife Tysha.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:34.370
So Tyrion as you can imagine had some self
esteem issues growing up.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.370
More than most teenagers.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:38.299
So when he finally fell in love with a peasant
girl named Tysha they got married.

00:03:38.299 --> 00:03:40.540
When Tywin found out that a lannister had
married a commoner he brutalized Tysha and

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:44.479
lied to Tyrion he had secretly paid her to
love him.

00:03:44.479 --> 00:03:47.979
Tyrion never found out what happened to her,
but he swore revenge.

00:03:47.979 --> 00:03:52.090
And my number 1 worst Tywin lannister moment
- The red wedding.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:57.280
Tywin was responsible for convincing Walder
Frey to perpetrate the Red Wedding in exchange

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:58.280
for favorable treatment.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.669
House Frey was actually an enemy of the Lannisters
during the war of the five kings, but Tywin

00:04:01.669 --> 00:04:04.511
promised to forgive that in exchange for the
heads of all the starks and the slaughter

00:04:04.511 --> 00:04:05.511
of their army.

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:10.650
It was basically like a sequel to The Rains
of Castamere.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.839
Which was the name of the red wedding episode
and the tune that played when the slaughter

00:04:12.839 --> 00:04:13.839
began.

